OL,3,GNEWSATeen charged with murder after
OL,4,Acouncil HQ stabbing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 15-year-old boy has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with murder after a teenager
OL,8,Fwas stabbed to death at a council
OL,9,Fheadquarters in north-west London.
OL,11,FDavid Wynter, 17, suffered fatal
OL,12,Finjuries after he was stabbed at Brent
OL,13,FCivic Centre on Engineers Way, Wembley,
OL,14,Fshortly before 2:30 BST on Tuesday, the
OL,15,FMetropolitan Police previously said.
OL,17,FThe 15-year-old boy, who cannot be
OL,18,Fnamed for legal reasons, appeared at
OL,19,FWillesden Magistrates' Court on
OL,20,FThursday charged with murder and
OL,21,Fpossession of a blade in a public
OL,22,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
